WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.370
A message says your account is blocked.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.100
Minutes later, the money is gone. Who do you call first?

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.560
Meet the Community Cyber First Responder.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.500
Fifteen hours in class.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.070
Fifteen hours online, on your phone.

6
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.640
Twenty-four hours helping your own community.

7
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.140
Then a portfolio and a short viva.

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.250
You learn to stop the loss, save the evidence, and report it.

9
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:51.650
1930. Be the first call after a scam.
